  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Meganeura monyi has a long narrow abdomen and four separate broad-based veined wings. Incomplete fossil preservation leaves head details, limb proportions, wing membranes and colour partly inferred rather than an intact living outline.",
    "zh": "巨脉蜻蜓 Meganeura monyi 具有狭长腹部和四片独立、基部宽阔且带翅脉的翅。化石保存不完整，头部细节、肢体比例、翅膜及颜色部分依赖推断，并非完整保存的活体轮廓。"
  },
